トも搭載しています[Sponsored]","title_link":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/special/1314901.html","text":"　レノボ・ジャパンの「ThinkPad X1 Nano Gen1」は13型のモバイルノートPC。その名が示すとおりのモバイル製品だが、ThinkPad史上最軽量となるのが本製品だ。ThinkPadというと堅牢な作りで定評があるが、その特質を受け継ぎつつ、軽量化を図った。最大約22～23時間のバッテリ駆動、最新の5Gへの対応、高品質なマイク音質/Webカメラ画質など死角のない製品となっている。","image_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/img/pcw/list/1314/901/ph01.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1618350900,"service_name":"PC Watch","service_icon":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/special/1314901.html","original_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/special/1314901.html"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qLS"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"b38ce3dc-9602-442a-9f4c-c5210ef2b54f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"すげーな、の一言ですね","ts":"1618397246.108300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":4,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U9S4G0LJW","UG6DF6W87","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FlcAl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73F4CB50-0C3E-4DC9-8E48-EBD9D7AAA9FD","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"そうなの？","ts":"1618397229.108100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":6,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U9S4G0LJW","UG6DF6W87","U013QL1RAPN","UD1FQV38V","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zs0Wl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b91d4c1-84d9-440f-951a-b3d00c6b3505","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"でも nano なら許せる気がする...","ts":"1618396710.107900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UQR3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"050bd682-4a4d-44f8-ac8b-c205f25e3cb9","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"X1 はメモリがオンボードなのがほんとうに...","ts":"1618396369.107400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena